---
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-32 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left side: Image/Visual -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="aspect-[4/4] md:aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden glass p-1 tilt-card">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/20 via-purple-500/10 to-surface">
              <img
                src="/picture/profile_2.jpg"
                alt="Kritsakorn Payakmareong"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right side: Content -->
      <div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="text-accent font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">About Me</span>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl mt-4 mb-8 leading-snug">
            Crafting digital<br />
            <span class="gradient-text">experiences</span> that matter
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p class="text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
            I'm Kritsakorn Payakmareong, a Full-stack Developer skilled in building scalable web applications with
            <span class="text-light font-medium">React.js, TypeScript, Node.js, PostgreSQL,</span> and
            <span class="text-light font-medium">Redis</span>. Experienced in RESTful API development, database design, Docker, Git, and production deployment workflows.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Recently completed an internship as a Programmer at
            <span class="text-light font-medium">Bay Computing Public Company Limited</span>, where I built a Field Service Management PWA and a real-time omnichannel platform, while leveraging AI tools like Claude and Codex. Currently finishing my Computer Science degree at
            <span class="text-light font-medium">Rangsit University</span> with a long-term goal of becoming a Software Engineer focused on System Design, Scalable Architecture, and DevSecOps.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stats -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6 mt-8 md:mt-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="text-center md:text-left">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold gradient-text" data-target="8" data-suffix="+">0+</div>
            <div class="text-muted text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1">Projects Built</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center md:text-left">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold gradient-text" data-target="15" data-suffix="+">0+</div>
            <div class="text-muted text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1">Technologies</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center md:text-left">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold gradient-text" data-target="4" data-suffix="+">0+</div>
            <div class="text-muted text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1">Years Learning</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
